Lomeric constant = 1.36 x 10⁻²⁰ J/nm²
Lattice energy = 1.36 x 10⁻²⁰ J/nm² * (1.602 x 10⁻¹⁹ C)² * (2.21 x 10⁻¹⁹ J nm) / 0.211 nm

Lattice energy = 1.025 x 10⁻²² J

