4. Grain shape: The presence of Si doping can also affect the shape of the grains. This is because the presence of Si atoms can also affect the interfacial energy between the grains, which can affect their shape.

5. Intercompatibility: The incorporation of Si can lead to the formation of Si-rich phases or amorphous phases, which can affect the sintering process and grain growth.

