  \[ \text{CH}_3\text{OH} + \text{SOCl}_2 \rightarrow \text{CH}_3\text{CO}_2 + \text{H}_2\text{O} + \text{SO}_2 \]  
- The reaction involves the formation of a carbonyl bond, releasing water and sulfur dioxide as by-products.  

