   \[
   A \cup B \neq A \text{ or } A \cap B \neq B
   \]

5. **Negverse of the implication**:  
   The negverse of the implication $A \cup B = A \implies A \cap B = B$ is:  
   \[
   A \cup B = A \text{ and } A \cap B \neq B
   \]

