   \[
   E_a = -RT \cdot m = -2 \times 1 \, \text{cal K}^{-1} \text{mol}^{-1} \times 8333.33 \, \text{K}^{-1} = -16666.67 \, \text{cal mol}^{-1}
   \]
   Converting to kJ mol\(^{-1}\):
   \[
   E_a = -16666.67 \times 10^{-3} \, \text{kJ mol}^{-1} = -16.67 \, \text{kJ mol}^{-1}
