\[
F = \frac{mv^2}{r}
\]

\[
3600 = \frac{m \times 800^2}{5.8 \times 10^8}
\]

\[
m = \frac{3600 \times 5.8 \times 10^8}{640,000} = 3.3 \times 10^4 \, \text{kg}
\]

The kinetic energy is:

\[
K = \frac{1}{2} m v^2 = \frac{1}{2} \times 33,000 \times 800^2 = 1.3 \times 10^{10} \, \text{J}
\]

