\[
C_{ox} = \frac{3.9 \times 8.854 \times 10^{-14}}{5 \times 10^{-6}} \approx 6.9 \times 10^{-8} \text{ F/cm}^2
\]

\[
\gamma = \frac{\sqrt{2 \times 1.6 \times 10^{-19} \times 11.7 \times 8.854 \times 10^{-14} \times 10^{16}}}{6.9 \times 10^{-8}} \approx 0.3 \text{ V}^{1/2}
\]

#### Step 3: Solve for \(V_{BS}\)
Substitute \(\Delta V_T = -1.0 \text{ V}\), \(\gamma = 0.3 \text{ V}^{1/2}\), and \(\phi_F = 0.36 \text{ V}\) into the body effect formula:

\[
-1.0 = 0.3 \left( \sqrt{|0.72 + V_{BS}|} - \sqrt{0.72} \right)
